    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n106977" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπασπ-ίδιος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[πῐ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσπίς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>covered with a shield,</i> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> only as Adv., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπασπίδια
				προποδίζων</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προβιβῶντι
				</span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-βῶντος</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.158
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				807
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.609
			</span></i>:—after Hom.as Adj., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. πολεμιστής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Asius
					<u>Fr.Ep.</u>
					13.7
				</span></i>
			 K.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ὑ. κόσμον</span> the
				<i>body</i>-armour and arms of Ajax, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				1408
			</span></i> (anap.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">&lt;&gt;. κοῖτον
				ἰαύειν</span> sleep an <i>armed</i> sleep, sleep <i>in
				arms,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				740
			</span></i> (anap.).</div>
